kind_of_product` | string | The site's product type code, e.g. `HEADPHONES`. |\n| `marketplace` | boolean | True when the product is a marketplace listing sold by a third party. |\n| `marketplace_seller` | object | The third-party seller of a marketplace offer; null for products MediaMarkt sells itself. |\n| `name` | string |  |\n| `observed_at_ms` | number | Unix epoch milliseconds when the program read the source. |\n| `online_status` | string | Online status code, e.g. `AVAILABLE`, `MP_OFFER` (marketplace offer), `NOT_AVAILABLE`. |\n| `pickup` | object | Store pickup availability without a selected store. |\n| `price` | number | Current price in EUR incl. VAT as shown; null when the product has no active offer. |\n| `product_id` | string | MediaMarkt article number (the number at the end of the product URL). |\n| `rating` | object | Null when the product has no reviews. |\n| `specs` | object[] | Specification table in page order. |\n| `strike_price` | number | Crossed-out reference price in EUR, only when the site strikes it through. |\n| `strike_price_type` | string | Kind of strike price the site reports, e.g. `LOP` (lowest previous price) or `RRP`. |\n| `url` | string | Canonical product page on www.mediamarkt.nl. |\n\n\nThese are the provider's documented fields. Field requiredness, nullability and nested object structures are specified only where the descriptions explicitly say so."},"default":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}},"description":"Error response; upstream passthrough responses may use provider formats"}},"summary":"Product","tags":["MediaMarkt Netherlands"],"x-aisa-capabilities":{"idempotency":"Idempotency-Key","max_price":"X-AISA-Max-Price-USD","mpp":false,"mpp_methods":[],"quote":{"header":"X-AISA-Cost-Mode","value":"quote"},"x402":false},"x-aisa-catalog-id":"mediamarkt-nl","x-aisa-category":"commerce","x-aisa-docs-url":"https://aisa.one/docs/api-reference/mediamarkt-nl/mediamarkt-nl-products-product","x-aisa-passthrough":true,"x-ais